{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107556","id":2593421860,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6alHok","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107556","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107556.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107556.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107556","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107556/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107556/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107556/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7d32495a8cca11e7af16865f159b171caff74cc5","number":107556,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":" Add nested container type support for Arrays and Dictionaries","user":{"login":"Sammyjroberts","id":5728289,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjgyODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5728289?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts","html_url":"https://github.com/Sammyjroberts","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sammyjroberts/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# Add nested container type support for Arrays and Dictionaries\r\n\r\n**This is a draft PR for review and feedback before completion**\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nThis PR implements comprehensive support for nested container types in GDScript, enabling syntax like:\r\n- `Array[Array[int]]`\r\n- `Array[Dictionary[String, CustomClass]]` \r\n- `Dictionary[String, Array[Vector3]]`\r\n- And deeper nesting up to 8 levels\r\n\r\n## Technical Approach\r\n\r\n### Core Changes\r\n\r\n**Enhanced Type System** (`container_type_validate.h`):\r\n- Extended `ContainerType` and `ContainerTypeValidate` with `nested_types` vectors\r\n- Added recursive validation methods for nested arrays and dictionaries\r\n- Implemented depth limiting (max 8 levels)\r\n- Enhanced `can_reference()` and equality operators for nested type compatibility\r\n\r\n**Array Implementation** (`array.cpp/h`):\r\n- Added constructor overload accepting `Vector<ContainerTypeValidate>` for nested types\r\n- Enhanced `assign()` and `append_array()` with nested type validation\r\n- Implemented bidirectional conversion utilities between `ContainerType` ↔ `ContainerTypeValidate`\r\n- Added `set_typed()` overload for nested type specification\r\n\r\n**Parser Integration** (`gdscript_parser.cpp/h`):\r\n- Modified type parsing to accept nested container syntax\r\n- Added depth validation during parsing (8 level limit)\r\n- Enhanced `DataType::to_string()` for proper nested type display\r\n- Added helper method `get_container_type_depth()` for validation\r\n\r\n**Type Analysis** (`gdscript_analyzer.cpp`):\r\n- Updated array literal type inference to handle nested structures\r\n- Enhanced type compatibility checking with recursive validation\r\n- Improved element type updating for nested array literals\r\n\r\n### Key Features\r\n✅ **Parse-time Validation**: Syntax errors caught during compilation  \r\n✅ **Recursive Operations**: Deep type checking for assignment, append, and other operations  \r\n✅ **Backward Compatibility**: Existing single-level typed arrays continue to work unchanged  \r\n\r\n## Example Usage\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n# Basic nested arrays\r\nvar nested_ints: Array[Array[int]] = [[1, 2], [3, 4]]\r\nvar matrix: Array[Array[Array[float]]] = [[[1.0, 2.0]], [[3.0, 4.0]]]\r\n\r\n# Mixed nested containers  \r\nvar lookup: Dictionary[String, Array[Vector3]] = {\r\n    \"positions\": [Vector3(1,2,3), Vector3(4,5,6)]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit:* This PR closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12224","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.c